OL,3,AToo early to say if Iran involved in
OL,4,ADubai-Tel Aviv flight attack, Israeli
OL,5,APM says
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is too early to say if Iran had any
OL,8,Finvolvement in an attack by a pilot who
OL,9,Fstabbed another pilot and tried to take
OL,10,Fover a flight from Dubai to Tel Aviv,
OL,11,FIsrael's prime minister has said.
OL,13,FThe Flydubai plane plunged more than
OL,14,F17,000ft (5,200m) two hours into its
OL,15,Fjourney on Wednesday, before passengers
OL,16,Fand crew overpowered the attacker and
OL,17,Fretook control to land safely.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
